  "uuid": "0488ba19-9fcc-8f4b-be00-21ad2bef242a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T15:55:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ricardo Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:54:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:54:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. [pause] Yeah, I'm calling about a streetlight. It's on all day long. Daytime, nighttime, doesn't matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:54:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a light that's staying on during the day. Where's it located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:54:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 220 Bellevue Avenue. The pole by my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:54:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 220 Bellevue. Do you know if there's a number on the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:54:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I haven't looked. [pause] Hang on. No, buddy, don't touch that. Sorry, my little one keeps hitting the speaker button."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:54:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, I hear it. I'm writing down, light on all day, 220 Bellevue Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:54:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Can you get a crew to come check the pole? [pause] It's been like this a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it. Want to leave a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0186."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:55:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0186. All set, Mr. Figueroa. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T15:55:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. You too."
    }
  ],
